sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Invoice as Invoice
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Invoice: writeOff(reason, writeOffAmount)
    Note over Invoice: Policies: invoiceRead, invoiceWrite, invoiceExecute
    Note over Invoice: Guards (2)
    Invoice->>Invoice: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;overdue#quot; or self.status == #quot;partial#quot;
    Invoice->>Invoice: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    Invoice->>Invoice: mutate.status
    Invoice->>Invoice: mutate.amountDue
    Invoice->>Invoice: mutate.writeOffReason
    Invoice->>Invoice: mutate.writtenOffAt
    Invoice->>EventBus: emit InvoiceWrittenOff on invoice.written_off
    Invoice-->>-Client: void